jobs.description:
For a client, we are looking for a DEMOLITION WORKER | PERMANENT CONTRACT in the WEST FLANDERS region.

• Carrying out thermal cutting works;
• Manually stripping and clearing buildings prior to demolition works;
• Performing basic asbestos removal works in accordance with applicable safety regulations;
• Ensuring a safe and tidy working environment;
• Correctly using and maintaining tools and work equipment.
Send your CV to westkust@absolutejobs.be.

What the client expects from a DEMOLITION WORKER | PERMANENT CONTRACT in WEST FLANDERS:

• You are an experienced construction worker who knows how to get things done and enjoys physically demanding work;
• You are flexible and enjoy working at different locations throughout West and East Flanders;
• Experience in asbestos removal is a plus;
• You speak Dutch, French OR English;
• You have a valid category B driving licence.

